  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the coordination of UNESCO and in collaboration with key regional and international partners including SPNL, BirdLife International, IUCN, and HIST UNESCO Centre, the project aims to strengthen existing Biosphere Reserves, assess and develop potential geopark sites, and establish a regional Community of Practice to accelerate peer-learning, technical cooperation, and knowledge exchange throughout the Levant region. This workplan is associated with Budget Element number RP Workplan - 43021078</narrative>
